<td id="A1.T2.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.5pt 4.0pt;"><span id="A1.T2.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ground-Truth Labels?</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.5pt 4.0pt;"><span id="A1.T2.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Data Drift?</span></td>
